{"id":"universal-audit-compliance-approved","input":{"target":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","context":"The governing verification model states that only a [test] assertion carries an assertion type. [eval] and [audit] assertions carry no assertion type. The canonical node templates group assertions under Scenarios, Mappings, Conformance, Properties, and Compliance according to claim shape. The toolchain admits the pathless [audit] tag.","spec_markdown":"---\nid: 01a0ebba-5f66-7099-bada-7c732ce43af8\n---\n\n# Evidence\n\nPROVIDES the test evidence lifecycle — writing tests from spec assertions, auditing evidence quality, and managing quality gate scope\nSO THAT all product-tree projects\nCAN verify that spec assertions are fulfilled by genuine test evidence rather than phantom green CI\n\n## Assertions\n\n### Compliance\n\n- ALWAYS: /test is the single authority that selects an assertion's verification type and, under test, its assertion type ([audit])\n- ALWAYS: select the verification type by fallback ([audit])\n- NEVER: infer an assertion type from the section or heading a rule sits under ([audit])"},"expected_verdict":{"must_contain":[{"terminalStatus":"approved","units":[{"unitId":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","auditKind":"spec","subject":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","coverageStatus":"audited","priorContext":{"changedFilePartition":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","concernPartition":"spec"}},{"unitId":"spec:section-structure:spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","parentUnitId":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","auditKind":"spec","subject":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","coverageStatus":"audited","priorContext":{"changedFilePartition":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","concernPartition":"section-structure"}},{"unitId":"spec:atemporal-voice:spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","parentUnitId":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","auditKind":"spec","subject":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","coverageStatus":"audited","priorContext":{"changedFilePartition":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","concernPartition":"atemporal-voice"}},{"unitId":"spec:tag-fitness:spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","parentUnitId":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","auditKind":"spec","subject":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","coverageStatus":"audited","priorContext":{"changedFilePartition":"spx/21-product-tree.enabler/35-evidence.enabler/evidence.md","concernPartition":"tag-fitness"}}],"findings":[]}],"must_not_contain":[{"terminalStatus":"rejected"},{"units":[{"coverageStatus":"incomplete"}]},{"findings":[{"rule":"heading-mismatch"}]}]}}
